id: pm-lint-reconcile-1023
title: Reconcile stale in-progress tracker records (2026-10-23)
description: "Audit current main, open pull requests and recently pushed live branches. Close only fully proved mainline delivery; release incomplete acceptance to open. Tracker and changelog only. Audit remains open until its pull request is reviewed and merged."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[2]: maintenance,tracker-reconciliation
created_at: "2026-10-23T15:30:47.464Z"
