completed_at: "2026-10-23T16:03:16.000Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Per-item verdicts cite inspected mainline artifacts and merged PR coordinates; protected work remains unchanged; append-only histories and local changelog/health checks are verified; submit tracker-only PR for orchestrator review
resolution: "Delivers inspected per-item audit decisions, stale-claim release, append-only history, strict health and regenerated changelog verification."
expected_result: Per-item verdicts cite inspected mainline artifacts and merged PR coordinates; protected work remains unchanged; append-only histories and local changelog/health checks are verified; submit tracker-only PR for orchestrator review
actual_result: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/pull/20, merged 2026-10-23T16:03:16Z, merge 31e3bd552c210ff22f9f2b3ec60a418004bbbfc6: Delivers inspected per-item audit decisions, stale-claim release, append-only history, strict health and regenerated changelog verification."
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T15:31:32.794Z",codex-agent,"Plan: reconcile 3 unprotected records against main 8346efab4bb7d778adf3151e442105eb692d3f97. Open PR changed tracker files and text were checked through REST. Recent push events were combined with currently live branch refs and changed tracker files; deleted refs are not active contention. No source changes or full local release reruns; CI owns the complete release gate. Preserve all prior history bytes."
  "2026-10-23T15:33:37.126Z",codex-agent,"Reconciliation writes complete. Linked git diff --check passed. All delivery coordinates and evidence files were checked against main; owner decisions and incomplete acceptance were retained as open. Final changelog generation/check, pinned health, append-only history, lifecycle/privacy/scope checks and push verification follow before PR submission. Full npm/Bun release gates are delegated to CI. This audit item remains open pending orchestrator review/merge."
  "2026-10-23T15:34:56.329Z",codex-agent,"Local tracker-only gate receipt: npm run changelog:full and npm run changelog:check both exit 0; npx pm health --json exits 0 in normal and isolated identities. Isolated health checks: 10 categories; advisory categories: none. Integrity and history drift pass. Linked git diff --check already passed. Original histories, expected lifecycles, protected records, public-safe added text and explicit tracker/changelog-only paths are independently asserted before commit. This comment is followed by final changelog regeneration/check and health. Complete npm/Bun release gates remain CI work; audit stays open pending review/merge."
